.\" Manpage for rclonefzf
.TH RCLONEFZF 1 "2026-01-06" "1.0.22" "rclonefzf manual"

.SH NAME
rclonefzf \- interactive terminal UI for browsing rclone remotes using fzf

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rclonefzf
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
[\fISEARCH QUERY\fR]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B rclonefzf
is a terminal-based interactive browser for rclone remotes powered by
.BR fzf (1).
It allows users to select configured rclone remotes, recursively browse
files, preview file contents using
.BR rclone\ cat ,
and manage selections using a keyboard-driven interface.

Configuration is loaded from standard XDG locations, and behavior such as
themes, layout, preview window, and keybindings can be customized.

.SH OPTIONS

.SS Search

.TP
.B \-\-no\-preview
Disable the package information preview window.

.SS Themes

.TP
.BI "\-t, \-\-theme " theme
Set the built-in fzf color theme.

.TP
.B \-l, \-\-list\-themes
Show the list of built-in themes and exit.

.TP
.B \-\-preview\-themes
Interactively preview and select a built-in theme.

After selecting a theme,
.B rclonefzf
launches with the selected theme. When that themed session exits, the theme selector is shown again.

.SS Configuration

.TP
.B \-i, \-\-init\-config
Install an example configuration file to the XDG config directory and exit.

.TP
.B \-s, \-\-show\-config
Show the active example configuration file content and exit.

If a user configuration file exists, it is shown. Otherwise, the built-in example configuration is printed.

.SS Information

.TP
.B \-k, \-\-keybindings
Show the list of available keybindings and exit.

.TP
.B \-v, \-\-verbose
Show verbose output.

.TP
.B \-h
Show the short help text and exit.

.TP
.B \-\-help
Show full help, including examples, keybindings, config file locations, version, and author information, then exit.

.TP
.B \-\-help\-man
Show the man page and exit.

.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
Show the
.B rclonefzf
version and exit.

.SH EXAMPLES

.TP
.B rclonefzf
Open the main menu.

.TP
.B rclonefzf doc
Start
.B rclonefzf
with an initial search query of
.BR 
doc.

.TP
.B rclonefzf \-\-theme dracula
Start
.B rclonefzf
using the
.B dracula
theme.

.TP
.B rclonefzf \-\-list\-themes
Show all built-in themes.

.TP
.B rclonefzf \-\-preview\-themes
Open the interactive theme selector.

.TP
.B rclonefzf \-\-no\-preview
Start
.B rclonefzf
with the package preview window disabled.

.TP
.B rclonefzf \-\-init\-config
Install an example configuration file.

.TP
.B rclonefzf \-h
Show the short help menu.

.SH USAGE
.TP
.B rclonefzf
Launch the interactive main menu and select a configured rclone remote.

.TP
.B rclonefzf "query"
Launch rclonefzf with an initial fzf search query.

.SH KEYBINDINGS

.TP
.B ↑
Move up

.TP
.B ↓
Move down

.TP
.B PGUP
Move up one page

.TP
.B PGDN
Move down one page

.TP
.B HOME
Move to first

.TP
.B END
Move to last

.TP
.B ENTER
Perform action on the current selection.

.TP
.B TAB
Select item.

.TP
.B Shift\-TAB
Unselect item.

.TP
.B Ctrl\-a
Select all items.

.TP
.B Ctrl\-d
Deselect all selected items.

.TP
.B Ctrl\-s
Download selected files

.TP
.B Ctrl\-l
Clear the current search query and screen.

.TP
.B Ctrl\-Backspace
Clear the current search query.

.TP
.B Ctrl\-/
Cycle fzf layout and preview window position.

.TP
.B Ctrl\-v
Toggle the preview window.

.TP
.B ?
Show keybindings.

.TP
.B Ctrl\-c
Exit rclonefzf.

.TP
.B Ctrl\-w
Exit rclonefzf.

.TP
.B ESC
Exit rclonefzf.

.SH CONFIGURATION

.B rclonefzf
loads the first configuration file found from the following locations, in order:

.RS
.IP \(bu 2
.BR "$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/rclonefzf/rclonefzf.conf"
.IP \(bu 2
.BR "$HOME/.config/rclonefzf/rclonefzf.conf"
.IP \(bu 2
.BR "$HOME/.rclonefzf.conf"
.RE

The configuration file is a shell-style file that can override default settings.

.SH ENVIRONMENT

.TP
.B THEME
Default built-in theme.

Default:
.RS
.B default
.RE


.TP
.B PREVIEW_WINDOW
Controls the fzf preview window layout and size.
Passed directly to fzf’s
.BR --preview-window
option.

.TP
.B ENABLE_PREVIEW
Enable or disable the preview window.
Valid values:
.B true
or
.B false .

.TP
.B LAYOUT
Set fzf layout.
Valid values:
.B default
or
.B reverse .

.TP
.B BORDER
Set fzf border style.
Valid values:
.B default
or
.B rounded .

.TP
.B VERBOSE
Enable verbose logging output.

.TP
.B RCLONEFZF_PAGER
Pager
(e.g.
.BR less ,
.BR bat ).

.TP
.B RCLONE_MAX_DEPTH
Maximum directory depth used when listing and previewing files.

.TP
.B RCLONEFZF_DOWNLOADS_DIR
Download directory
(e.g.
.BR ~/downloads/rclonefzf ,
.BR PWD ).

.TP
.B NO_COLOR
Disable ANSI color output.

When set to
.BR true ,
.B rclonefzf
disables colored output in messages and disables yay color output.

.SH FILES

.TP
.B $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/rclonefzf/rclonefzf.conf
Primary XDG configuration file.

.TP
.B $HOME/.config/rclonefzf/rclonefzf.conf
Default configuration path when
.B XDG_CONFIG_HOME
is not set.

.TP
.B $HOME/.rclonefzf.conf
Legacy fallback configuration file.

.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Successful execution.

.TP
.B 1
An error occurred.

.SH DEPENDENCIES

.B rclonefzf
requires:

.RS
.IP \(bu 2
.B bash
.IP \(bu 2
.B yay
.IP \(bu 2
.B fzf
.IP \(bu 2
.B sed
.IP \(bu 2
.B tr
.IP \(bu 2
.B tput
.RE

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rclone (1)
.BR fzf (1)

